## 6. Sizing Guidelines & Fit Assurance
- **Measurement Metric:** Indian ethnic garments are sized by actual **chest/bust circumference in inches** (e.g., Size 38 = 38-inch bust).
- **European Size Equivalency:**
  - Size 34 = 34 in bust (86 cm) -> EU 34 / DE 34 (XS)
  - Size 36 = 36 in bust (91 cm) -> EU 36 / DE 36 (S)
  - Size 38 = 38 in bust (96 cm) -> EU 38 / DE 38 (M)
  - Size 40 = 40 in bust (101 cm) -> EU 40 / DE 40 (L)
  - Size 42 = 42 in bust (106 cm) -> EU 42 / DE 42 (XL)
  - Size 44 = 44 in bust (111 cm) -> EU 44 / DE 44 (2XL)
  - Size 46 = 46 in bust (116 cm) -> EU 46 / DE 46 (3XL)
- **Built-In Inner Seam Margins:** Most Neha Couture blouses and suits feature up to **4 cm (1.5 inches)** of inner fabric allowance along side seams, allowing easy alterations at home or by a local tailor.

